*d*, *c* 70 *c₂*♯ 134 *d*; which of these is the player to play, or the singer to sing (a question of importance when each part is sustained by many unaccompanied voices)? Practically the player will take the most handy interval, and the singers must arrange in @@A0@@
>>>
<<<
@@A0@@
