rehearsal, but would possibly take *c* 92 *c₁*♯ 112 *d*, *d* 92 *d¹*♭ 112 *c*, as these are the intervals used in modulation from *f* to *f₁*♯ to the dominant, and *b₁* to *b*♭ to the subdominant.—*Translator.*]
